# Git LFS — the large binary artifacts produced by
# experiments/traffic-sign_recognition (trained weights, plots, NCNN blobs).
#
# Scoped to that one results/ path by extension, deliberately. A repo-wide
# `*.pt` or `*.mp4` rule would also swallow the 455 MB dashcam clip in
# experiments/traffic-sign_recognition/ and ~260 MB of video in
# experiments/distance_estimation/ — together most of GitHub's 1 GB free LFS
# quota, for files nothing needs versioned. The grid's own artifacts are ~80 MB.
#
# .csv / .yaml / .md / .param stay in normal git: small, diffable, greppable.
experiments/traffic-sign_recognition/results/**/*.pt  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
experiments/traffic-sign_recognition/results/**/*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
experiments/traffic-sign_recognition/results/**/*.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
